      "short": "Painting of two hay bales in a colorful field under a soft sky, with distant trees and hills.",
      "long": "A horizontally oriented painting showing two large, rounded hay bales in an open field. The foreground and midground are rendered in short, visible brushstrokes of green, pink, lavender, and ochre. Behind the bales, a band of dark green and purple suggests a treeline and low hills, with faint hints of buildings. The sky above is pale and hazy, composed of blended strokes of gray-green, yellow, and off-white. A signature appears in red in the lower-left corner.",
